                "text": "<strong>chopped on! Broad gets Warner again. Edgbaston erupts!</strong> Wide tempter, not quite a half volley, Warner throws his hands at a full blooded drive with no footwork and drags a thick inside edge back onto the stumps. Warner throws his head back in disbelief."
