                "shortText": "Stokes to Smith, OUT",
                "text": "appeal for lbw as Smith goes back to defend one that nips back in, and Erasmus thinks for a long time and raises his finger! Seemed like height could have been an issue, maybe? <strong>Smith has reviewed</strong>... Back and across to defend and it nips in to strike him on the flap of the front pad, juuust in line with off stump, and ball-tracking says it's hitting the top of the stumps, and it's not just umpire's call. Stokes is delighted, as is all of England. Massive moment"
