                "shortText": "Anderson to Carey, OUT",
                "text": "<b>sneaks one through, pings the bails!</b> Anderson is back in the contest with the first wicket of this, his tenth Ashes series! Precision engineering from the old technician, and England have finally broken this sixth-wicket stand. On a length, wobble-seam delivery and it nips back inside the defensive push to rattle the stumps"
